      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789809573241,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tuple can be defined by :\n\ncoordinates = (1,2,3)\n\n-> create an empty tuple \nthistuple = ()\n\n-> tuple with one item \nthistuple = (\"hello\",) #Add comma or its just a string\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tuple can be defined by :\n\ncoordinates = (1,2,3)\n\n-> create an empty tuple \nthistuple = ()\n\n-> tuple with one item \nthistuple = (\"hello\",) #Add comma or its just a string\n",
