      "text": "Functions in python are used to reduce redundancy.\n\n-> Define a function \ndef func_name(param1,param2): #give parameters\n    #Some work\n    return value\n\n-> Calling a function\n\nfunc_name(arg1,arg2) #Argument are the input values",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functions in python are used to reduce redundancy.\n\n-> Define a function \ndef func_name(param1,param2): #give parameters\n    #Some work\n    return value\n\n-> Calling a function\n\nfunc_name(arg1,arg2) #Argument are the input values",
