      "updated": 1789809573241,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "These are Class Attributes , They belong \nto class. However , We havent \nmentioned Instance Attributes yet.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "These are Class Attributes , They belong \nto class. However , We havent \nmentioned Instance Attributes yet.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bPaEa75WELUswU8lyvBYi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1131.731454701491,
      "y": 3388.38683255501,
      "width": 531.0396728515625,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b19",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1736565513,
      "version": 365,
      "versionNonce": 1119345160,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789809573241,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So how do we create an Instance Attribute?\n\nfor eg : \n\ntyrion.wife = \"Sansa Stark\"\n\n#if we do - print(tyrion.wife)\nit will print \"Sansa Stark\"\n\nSo tyrion has a wife that doesnt belong to the class \nbut himself(Object).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So how do we create an Instance Attribute?\n\nfor eg : \n\ntyrion.wife = \"Sansa Stark\"\n\n#if we do - print(tyrion.wife)\nit will print \"Sansa Stark\"\n\nSo tyrion has a wife that doesnt belong to the class \nbut himself(Object).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
