      "text": "Why do we use \"self\" as an argument?\n\nif we didnt use self and ran -> getInfo(ishaan)\n\nthe \"getInfo\" means Employee.getInfo(ishaan)\n\nand if we never used self as an argument where\nwill ishaan go? , Since we didnt define any",
