      "version": 408,
      "versionNonce": 1664492664,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789813399374,
      "created": 1789810392111,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Python library to perform type & data validation , Since python is dynamically typed \nlanguage.\neg :\n\na = 10 #a is now 10 (int)\na = \"ishaan\" #a is now ishaan(string)\na = 4.5 #a is now 4.5(float)\n\nPydantic helps you to build DATAMODELS , and easily structure complex data.\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Python library to perform type & data validation , Since python is dynamically typed \nlanguage.\neg :\n\na = 10 #a is now 10 (int)\na = \"ishaan\" #a is now ishaan(string)\na = 4.5 #a is now 4.5(float)\n\nPydantic helps you to build DATAMODELS , and easily structure complex data.\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
