      "text": "from pydantic import BaseModel\nfrom typing import List , Dict , Optional  \n\nclass Patient(BaseModel): #STEP 1 : Schema definition\n    name : str\n    age : int\n    weight : float\n    married : Optional[bool] =False #false is default value\n    allergies : List[str]\n    contact_detail : Dict[str,str] \n\npatient_info = {\n    \"name\" : \"ishaan\",\n    \"age\" : 20,\n    \"weight\" : 51,\n    \"allergies\" : [\"dust\"],\n    \"contact_detail\" : {\n    \"email\" : \"ishaanabc@gmail.com\",\n    \"phone\" : \"932xxx04xx\"\n    }\n    \n}\n\npatient1 = Patient(**patient_info) #Creating a Pydantic Object using above dictionary\n#unpacking the data inside the dict using **\n\ndef insert_patient_data(patient : Patient): #We are getting patient object Patient type(class) ka\n    print(patient.name)\n    print(patient.age)\n    print(patient.weight)\n    print(patient.allergies)\n    print(patient.contact_detail)\n    print(\"inserted\")\n\ninsert_patient_data(patient1) # we need to pass a patient object and it is \"patient1\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "from pydantic import BaseModel\nfrom typing import List , Dict , Optional  \n\nclass Patient(BaseModel): #STEP 1 : Schema definition\n    name : str\n    age : int\n    weight : float\n    married : Optional[bool] =False #false is default value\n    allergies : List[str]\n    contact_detail : Dict[str,str] \n\npatient_info = {\n    \"name\" : \"ishaan\",\n    \"age\" : 20,\n    \"weight\" : 51,\n    \"allergies\" : [\"dust\"],\n    \"contact_detail\" : {\n    \"email\" : \"ishaanabc@gmail.com\",\n    \"phone\" : \"932xxx04xx\"\n    }\n    \n}\n\npatient1 = Patient(**patient_info) #Creating a Pydantic Object using above dictionary\n#unpacking the data inside the dict using **\n\ndef insert_patient_data(patient : Patient): #We are getting patient object Patient type(class) ka\n    print(patient.name)\n    print(patient.age)\n    print(patient.weight)\n    print(patient.allergies)\n    print(patient.contact_detail)\n    print(\"inserted\")\n\ninsert_patient_data(patient1) # we need to pass a patient object and it is \"patient1\"",
