    {
      "id": "U3TjzYHjUJbS8wztQtxQV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2820.4999476038793,
      "y": -2935.1831473773464,
      "width": 691.7273559570312,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b49",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 111024648,
      "version": 802,
      "versionNonce": 1464544776,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789834025977,
      "created": 1789833325643,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So how do we create a Field that is doing Data validation.\n\n1. Using Prebuilt Datatypes: \n-> field_name : Datatype\n\neg : \n\nemail : EmailStr\nlinkedin_link : Anylink\n\n2. Using our constraints:\n-> field_name : Annotated[data_type,Field(constraints)]\n-> field_name : int = Field(constraints)]\n\neg:\n\nWith annotation:\nage : Annotated[int , Field(gt=0 , lt = 120),title = \"Age\",description = \"Fill you age here\"]\n\nWithout annotation:\nage : int = Field(gt=0,lt=120)\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So how do we create a Field that is doing Data validation.\n\n1. Using Prebuilt Datatypes: \n-> field_name : Datatype\n\neg : \n\nemail : EmailStr\nlinkedin_link : Anylink\n\n2. Using our constraints:\n-> field_name : Annotated[data_type,Field(constraints)]\n-> field_name : int = Field(constraints)]\n\neg:\n\nWith annotation:\nage : Annotated[int , Field(gt=0 , lt = 120),title = \"Age\",description = \"Fill you age here\"]\n\nWithout annotation:\nage : int = Field(gt=0,lt=120)\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
